{"id":"vod_sn_36886","vodId":"36886","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"名侦探柯南OVA4","name_cn":"名侦探柯南OVA4","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/5ab85f2909f6044a054dd9ad83b6f5a2.jpg"},"summary":"在一列从东京开往大阪的特快列车上，坐着一位尊贵而特殊的客人。她是来自欧洲英格拉姆帝国女王莎莉贝丝，随行的还有其年幼的儿子菲利浦王子。女王拥有一颗欧洲最大的宝石——水晶之母，这也引起了怪盗基德的注意。为了防止基德得手，女王身边布置大批保镖和警力。中森警官是日本警方的总代表，而他的女儿青子以及基德的真身快斗也同在这列火车之上。　　眼看离预定时间越来越近，快斗却始终没有找到宝石真正的藏匿地点。与此同时，国际宝石大盗杰卡尔和罗丝也尾随前来，他们企图在基德得手之际趁火打劫。同在火车上的柯南从伪装成乘务员的罗丝身上看出蹊跷。一场宝石的攻防战随即展开……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:46:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1X4hiyXchH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sd9WNWmnnH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vBtN6Ba7Xw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qav8inC6c91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FWFd3KZmhb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ahF8Cw5fA41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uzkfxuHEEQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gazbYWcUQj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V3qmmRsAsV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8SwSKWKxqC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rb1dafBAYc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cyBcH8qtXp1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:17.747Z"}